From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 13:04:42 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 331/333] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on 0330: name the
 chats that start on a login at their next message

The server now lists a child or move-all chat that had no terminal running as
queued instead of moved, since only its stored login changed. The family
dialog's toast says "N child chats start on X at their next message" and the
Move all toast counts those chats apart from the moved ones, naming the login.
Queued chats re-read their labels like moved ones.
---
